 'connect.demoMailHelp':["Per collegare Gmail, Outlook o un provider IMAP, configura Supabase e le integrazioni email sul server.","To connect Gmail, Outlook or an IMAP provider, configure Supabase and server-side email integrations.","Para conectar Gmail, Outlook o IMAP, configura Supabase y las integraciones de correo en el servidor.","Pour connecter Gmail, Outlook ou IMAP, configurez Supabase et les intégrations e-mail côté serveur.","Für Gmail, Outlook oder IMAP Supabase und serverseitige E-Mail-Integrationen konfigurieren.","Para ligar Gmail, Outlook ou IMAP, configure o Supabase e as integrações de email no servidor."],
